From 0d866942ad48eb3881338215d036f7a3d4c79f4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:25:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] FIXFULL9050: the Out Arm yield point
 (MoveOutArmXY_ToFix_Tray_Full) is the Auto3 X/Y on HT9050 -- EastSun 1008
 (00:19 WAR240198 MOutArmX Motor Alarm, 'which function?') -> 'split it with
 the HT9050 flag and use the Auto3 X/Y'.

Out Arm case 300 (nothing held, nothing on the Out Shuttle) yields through MoveOutArmXY_ToFix_Tray_Full; golden X = MOutArmX PSoftLimitN + iOutArmXBase*2000 + 100, and this Mot_Table has SoftLimitN -999999, so the target was about -999899: the axis ran from 00:19:18 and the drive alarmed (0x8310) at 00:19:19. aoutarm.cpp: on HT9050 (9050GPIB or Type_HT9050) X / Y = Tech.iOutArmAuto3X / Tech.iOutArmAuto3Y (teach.ini setEditAuto3X 34857 / setEditAuto3Y 12987). Other machines: golden. Same line. W6_2_OutArmVariants, Flow9050_Shuttle passed. Release linked; Debug compiled (link waits for EastSun's program). WORKLOG row 195.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 aoutarm.cpp             | 2 +-
 docs/WORKLOG_MACHINE.md | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/aoutarm.cpp b/aoutarm.cpp
index ae66fc8..1c8feb5 100644
--- a/aoutarm.cpp
+++ b/aoutarm.cpp
@@ -950,7 +950,7 @@ bool MoveOutArmXY_ToFix_Tray_Full(bool bMoveY)
             iYPos=Prod.iOutArmSafeY_FixFull;
         else
             iYPos=Prod.iOutArmSafeY;
-    }
+    }  { extern AnsiString W906_GpibModel; if(W906_GpibModel=="9050GPIB" || MachineTypeChoice==Type_HT9050) { iXPos=Tech.iOutArmAuto3X; iYPos=Tech.iOutArmAuto3Y; } }   //AI(W906-FIXFULL9050) 20261008: EastSun 1008 "MoveOutArmXY_ToFix_Tray_Full: split it with the HT9050 flag and use the Auto3 X/Y instead" -- the golden yield point X = MOutArmX PSoftLimitN + iOutArmXBase*2000 + 100 ran to -999899 on this machine (Mot_Table SoftLimitN -999999) and the drive alarmed (00:19 WAR240198, Out Arm case 300). HT9050: the Out Arm Auto3 teach point (teach.ini [MOutArmX] / [MOutArmY] setEditAuto3X / Y). Other machines: golden
 
     iXVariable[0]=MOT[MOutArmPitch].ReadPos();
     if(USE_OUT_ARM_Y_PITCH==iXYPitchVariable ||                                 //JerryYang 20251218 : IN/OUT ARM支援不同模組
